  "solution": "Isothermal: $\\dfrac{dP}{dV} = -\\dfrac{P}{V}$. Adiabatic: $\\dfrac{dP}{dV} = -\\gamma\\dfrac{P}{V}$. The adiabatic slope is $\\gamma$ times steeper.",
